ini ha-yotidagi yagona quvonch, yagona umid deb ataydi. Yozuvchi vafotidan so\'ng uning yodi bilan yashagan Anna barcha qo lyozmalar, maktublar, hujjatlarni yig\'ib tartibga keltiradi va ushbu memuar asarni yozishga bel bog\'laydi.\nAlbatta, yozuvchining iste\'dodi ayoliga ham ko\'chgani shubhasiz, chunki kitob samimiy, ravon, qiziqarli yozilgan. Ushbu memuar dunyo-ning ko\'plab tillariga o\'girilgan va sevib o\'qib kelinmoqda.',39000,0,NULL,14,'uz','cyrillic','soft',2025,366,1,55,0,1,0,0,2,0,2,0,0,0,'[0.006901154, -0.02224492, -0.030502338, 0.020338522, 0.013268517, -0.028127514, -0.015294744, -0.018464807, 0.007636478, -0.07982898, -0.024336508, -0.0469736, 0.00076392014, -0.012233616, -0.006661493, 0.0756458, -0.00414505, -0.036341358, 0.0032463202, 0.045884233, -0.01112246, 0.0035840247, -0.015044189, -0.02939118, 0.01153642, 0.017015947, -0.004471861, 0.05307407, 0.05895666, -0.019434346, 0.0069392817, -0.016983267, 0.0473222, -0.015262063, 0.0013998394, -0.010060324, 0.024031484, -0.033596147, 0.025425877, 0.0014216268, -0.041548543, 0.00025225707, 0.00035234285, -0.013344773, 0.015970152, -0.0044582435, 0.037888262, -0.029630842, 0.039130144, -0.026798483, -0.0395441, -0.0034995987, -0.05307407, 0.058695212, 0.016318751, -0.024489019, -0.004106922, 0.005065567, 0.026253797, -0.02699457, -0.032005668, -0.025142642, 0.016569305, 0.04104743, -0.001208519, 0.019837413, -0.028258238, -0.0026607844, -0.048585866, 0.028345387, 0.058172315, 0.0053460794, 0.054207012, -0.0015496277, 0.032877162, -0.0064218314, 0.009335894, -0.009216064, 0.034249768, 0.0071408153, -0.022005258, 0.07054755, -0.050677456, 0.0013419667, 0.01043071, -0.023334289, -0.06244264, 0.0065580024, 0.011040757, -0.048367992, -0.018628214, 0.04815012, 0.0008326866, 0.0039734743, 0.065449305, 0.027299592, 0.0566472, -0.00018825661, -0.02198347, -0.059305258, 0.00689026, -0.029129732, 0.033182185, 0.024946555, 0.05106963, -0.002756104, 0.002105206, -0.04381443, 0.011253184, -0.021101082, -0.0946444, -