risa hamda ajoyib jarroh. Qarshilikning umidsiz qahramoni va o\'tkir optimistik biznesmen. Bunday turli toifadagi insonlarni nima birlashtirib turgan bolishi mumkin? Tuturiqsiz muhojirona hayotning mo\'rtligimi yoki bir kun kelib uyga qaytishning mugaddas umidi?\nErix Mariya Remarkning o\'zbek tiliga ilk marotaba tarjima gilingan «Jannatdagi soyalar» kitobi mutolasi davomida yuqoridagi savolga birgalikda javob topamiz.',50000,0,NULL,6,'uz','latin','hard',2025,478,1,55,0,1,1,50000,1,1,1,50000,0,0,'[0.0027883847, -0.009676785, -0.002176186, 0.049922988, -0.007894712, 0.0033522926, -0.0044676466, 0.011957341, 0.011352931, -0.0433181, -0.038482822, -0.043966126, 0.013521329, -0.014306438, 0.030432336, 0.085738935, 0.008206262, 0.0045953826, 0.0020344304, 0.014493369, 0.014568141, 0.03118006, -0.022855407, -0.009390158, 0.01734718, 0.034843903, -0.01588912, 0.002708939, 0.052988652, -0.053487137, 0.044140596, -0.024151461, 0.034245726, -0.017571496, -0.04573574, -0.006879054, 0.064154655, -0.07487202, 0.007165681, -0.002394272, -0.04446461, -0.028263938, 0.0013848457, -0.021933215, 0.027167277, -0.030806197, -0.010711135, -0.010169036, 0.04665793, -0.034195878, -0.02172136, -0.0017774005, -0.038408052, 0.07028598, -0.026544174, -0.07377536, -0.030432336, 0.077763215, 0.029435372, -0.037460934, -0.01802013, -0.04429014, 0.022705862, 0.0031902858, -0.020512542, -0.009034989, -0.04920019, 0.014181818, -0.00897891, 0.017783351, 0.016225595, 0.048926026, 0.063855566, 0.045611117, 0.0070659844, 0.0051842146, 0.024064226, -0.021995526, 0.058023322, -0.027441444, -0.017932896, 0.00758316, -0.057225753, 0.0698872, 0.020786706, -0.01340917, -0.0851906, -0.006218565, 0.002766576, 0.0027042658, -0.0011893472, 0.02960984, -0.027217126, 0.007639239, 0.0741243, -0.0072342223, 0.020836554, 0.00788848, -0.03367247, -0.039953344, 0.03020802, -0.03172839, -0.013521329, 0.023067262, 0.055530913, -0.009894871, 0.02567183, -0.024263619, 0.021746283, 0.0013435652, -0.100494005, -0.031628694, 0