_0.jpg\", \"books/1765699720_1.jpg\"]','Germaniya, 1920-yillar. Birinchi jahon urushidagi fojialar ortda qoldi, ammo uning yaralari hamon jamiyat va inson qalbini vayron gil-moqda. \"Qora yodgorlik\" - Erix Mariya Remarkning ma\'naviy izlanish-lari, qalb sargardonligi va urushdan keyingi ma\'naviy bo\'shliq haqidagi ta sirli romani.\nAsarda g\'amangiz tuyg\'ular bilan boyitilgan voqealar urush qatnash-chisi bolgan yosh yigit Lyudvig Bodmer atrofida rivojlanadi. U yangi ha-yotga moslashishga, muhabbat, ma\'no va inson qadrini topishga harakat giladi. Bir qarashda sodda kundalik hayot ortidagi romanida Remark o\'zining doimiy mavzulari - jasorat, insoniylik, ishonch va ma\'naviy tushkunlikni ozida mujassamlashtirgan badily g\'oyalarini ilgari suradi.\n\"Qora yodgorlik\" - bu faqat urush haqidagi kitob emas. U odamlar haqi-da, xotira to\'g\'risida, hayotda o\'z yolini topishga uringan qalblar borasi-dagi kitob. Remark uslubiga xos bolgan murakkab, nozik va qalbga ta\'sir qiluvchi tuyg\'ular bu asarni ham adabiy gavharga aylantiradi.',57000,0,NULL,10,'uz','latin','hard',2025,525,1,55,0,1,0,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,'[0.03329778, 0.03406266, -0.006160472, 0.040283687, -0.04390412, 0.01151782, -0.028224077, 0.00037805794, -0.0038977016, -0.04632624, -0.03579639, -0.054918393, 0.03056971, 0.00018823222, 0.06302612, 0.08974594, 0.0159605, -0.0046530208, 0.0031933745, 0.048544392, -0.008305323, -0.021480383, -0.028504534, 0.0023886568, 0.020065356, -0.0042610196, 0.009235928, 0.0035885626, 0.039008886, -0.025827453, 0.014239518, -0.020154592, 0.030671693, -0.041558485, -0.0453064, -0.028555525, 0.04471999, -0.041329022, 0.008298949, 0.021429392, -0.05379657, -0.082913004, 0.006275204, 0.016457671, 0.043674655, -0.014137534, 0.044770982, -0.014711195, 0.04158398, -0.032328933, -0.015527067, 0.026719812, -0.04772852, 0.056091208, 0.0016875168, -0.056448154, -0.02411922, 0.039212856, -0.0022261199, 0.00044697683, -0.043445192, -0.054714426, 0.051425442, 0.008630398, 0.00505777, -0.00948451