,(173,'Yulduzli tunlar','Primqul Qodirov',6,'[\"books/1765707166_0.jpg\", \"books/1765707166_1.jpg\"]','\"Yulduzli tunlar\"- O\'zbekiston xalq yozuychisi Pirimqul Qo. dirov qalamiga mansub tarixiy roman. Asarda Zahiriddin Mu- hammad Bobur hayoti haqida so\'z yuritiladi. Yozuvchi mazkur roman ustida o\'n yil (1969 -1978) davomida ish olib borgan. Ushbu nashr muallifning 1999-yilgi so nggi tuzatishlari asosida nashrga tayyorlandi. \"Yulduzli tunlar\" dunyoning bir necha tillariga, jumladan, rus, qoraqalpoq, qirg\'iz, qozoq, urdu, turkman, hind, bengal, turk, 2022-yil esa yapon tiliga tarjima qilingan.',28000,0,NULL,10,'uz','latin','hard',2025,638,1,59,0,1,0,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,'[-0.032295465, 0.018139172, -0.005362663, -0.015385295, 0.0032204427, -0.032158908, -0.015043905, 0.01027014, -0.04335649, -0.05762658, -0.021040983, -0.031658202, 0.008961479, -0.019322656, 0.020597178, 0.04970634, -0.0071350443, -0.021974117, 0.03407069, 0.04201369, -0.0064010564, -0.045473106, -0.03011057, 0.0062417416, 0.025035243, 0.018992646, -0.019698184, 0.048932523, 0.045860015, -0.012529002, 0.03409345, -0.0032488918, -0.001101693, -0.010093755, -0.017251559, -0.026423562, 0.037234236, -0.030611275, 0.0048875622, -0.031180259, -0.056670688, -0.026696673, -0.01788882, -0.033638265, 0.051709156, 0.016113592, 0.01920886, -0.014008357, 0.023737963, 0.014816312, 0.0020810547, 0.0037922703, -0.056761727, 0.04856837, 0.033797577, -0.010452215, -0.027629806, 0.039009463, -0.00991737, -0.050161526, -0.035276935, -0.027675323, 0.029609865, 0.026742192, 0.010736706, -0.016068075, -0.04276475, -0.04665659, -0.020597178, 0.01554461, 0.034275524, -0.009001308, 0.06490956, -0.004594536, 0.023419332, 0.031635445, 0.014770794, 0.051026378, 0.04401651, -0.05758106, -0.025877338, 0.011948639, -0.030429201, 0.043811675, -0.025467671, 0.043584082, -0.055441685, 0.0017610018, 0.050434638, -0.055669278, -0.018810572, 0.019664045, -0.004102366, -0.016796373, 0.03306928, -0.0013371096, 0.070918016, 0.009905991, -0.