tiga kiradi. Ammo\n\"Urush san\'ati\"ning dolzarbligi harbiy soha bilan\ncheklanmaydi. Ushbu kitob saboqlari siyosat, huquq, biznes va sportda ham keng qo\'llanadi. Binobarin, Sun Zi yozgan asar nafaqat mudofaa va xavfsizlik sohalarida mehnat qilayotganlar hamda harbiy o\'quv yurtlarida ta\'lim olayotganlar, balki siyosatchi, huquqshunos, tadbirkor va sportchilar uchun ham foydalidir.',30000,0,NULL,12,'uz','latin','soft',2025,92,1,55,0,1,0,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,'[0.0023108304, -0.0048797852, -0.014332064, 0.05614826, 0.025861632, -0.02025664, -0.030778293, 0.03940703, 0.008770092, -0.05496826, 0.018658726, -0.02471851, 0.01139436, 0.009003634, 0.0057647843, 0.020293515, -0.015585813, -0.029499961, 0.007092282, -0.011289881, 0.0381287, 0.05555826, -0.02143664, -0.0015418339, 0.017650811, 0.006692804, 0.037292868, 0.005807805, 0.01763852, -0.026918715, 0.03247454, -0.01586852, -0.014319773, -0.016114354, -0.041693278, -0.0027994234, 0.013422483, -0.010171341, 0.0014427325, 0.0038165576, 0.02010914, -0.017749144, 0.009384675, -0.030507877, 0.04066078, -0.039357863, 0.014774564, -0.04594619, -0.00020262018, -0.000092955604, -0.025222467, -0.012076546, 0.0015272376, 0.041373696, 0.022813303, -0.02085893, -0.01809331, 0.0058170236, -0.0008127854, 0.0257633, -0.0038657242, -0.029524544, 0.024484968, 0.044790775, 0.025861632, -0.0059307213, -0.015438313, -0.046831187, -0.029426211, -0.05221493, 0.04712619, 0.03225329, 0.086434886, 0.032179542, 0.04105411, -0.03075371, 0.010552382, 0.010804361, 0.013864982, -0.042479943, -0.028811628, -0.0000073521837, -0.04080828, 0.025492882, -0.0140001895, 0.02226018, -0.07999406, 0.011941339, 0.008167801, -0.060868252, -0.02099414, 0.026132049, 0.014885189, -0.03262204, 0.022997677, -0.0051348372, 0.04351244, 0.02516101, -0.029794961, -0.0747824, 0.009802591, -0.028811628, 0.0063732206, 0.056541592, 0.0032511416, 0.016814979, -0.024939759, -0.0519691, 0.007964989, 0.021461222, -0.0780274, -0.019900182, 0.007909677, 0.026402466, 0.0069447826, -0.