 maktublar\" kitobxonni inson tabiati, uning dunyodagi o\'rni va hayotning ma\'nosi haqida o\'ylashga majbur qiladigan chuqur va teran mulohazalarga undovchi asardir.\nOgohlantirib qo\'yaylikki, bu asarni kechqurun o\'qishni boshlasangiz, tonggacha ko\'zingizga uyqu kelmaydi. Tongda \'qishni boshlasangiz, ishga yoki o\'qishga borishni ham unuttirib o\'yadi. O\'n-o\'n besh sahifasini o\'giganingizdan keyin yana boshidan o\'qishni xohlab qolasiz... Shuningdek, mutolaa davomida aql-idrokingiz bilan hissiyotingiz, istaklaringiz o\'zaro kurashga kirishadi.',32000,0,NULL,12,'uz','latin','soft',2025,158,1,55,0,1,1,32000,1,1,1,32000,0,0,'[-0.018564738, -0.011887749, -0.055581428, 0.028986255, -0.0006439432, 0.028377205, -0.020764085, 0.008628204, 0.020459559, -0.07416872, -0.0072070886, -0.058468774, 0.021181395, 0.009722238, 0.004438168, 0.06514576, 0.01976028, -0.019455755, -0.017899295, 0.027610254, 0.00065063994, -0.022252873, -0.034354918, 0.00022310676, 0.0041815774, 0.0343098, -0.00407443, 0.033272162, 0.05882969, -0.021790447, -0.0073198755, -0.017278966, 0.033678193, -0.038167115, 0.02003097, -0.0032708226, 0.022151364, -0.041821416, 0.017233852, 0.0075454493, -0.03866338, -0.03354285, -0.0039390856, -0.043152303, 0.02521917, -0.02713655, 0.032798454, -0.039994266, 0.039475445, -0.03275334, -0.050077423, -0.012248667, -0.030971307, 0.06916098, 0.0153615875, -0.02088815, -0.015214965, 0.0106640095, 0.029888552, -0.0017284605, 0.0008628204, 0.0044720042, 0.009022959, 0.042588364, 0.003978561, 0.008656401, -0.04128004, -0.009073713, -0.044505745, 0.0063329893, 0.06762708, 0.023414578, 0.056799527, 0.011515551, 0.015857851, -0.0015212145, 0.020301657, 0.008611286, 0.027181664, -0.03875361, -0.0012040011, 0.023369463, -0.039204758, 0.03173826, -0.0046581025, -0.002054133, -0.076920725, -0.029708093, 0.010895223, -0.074935675, -0.027204221, 0.063747205, 0.0126998145, -0.012587028, 0.073311545, -0.015801458, 0.035482787, -0.0066713504, -0.051115062, -0.101418056, 0.015237