i deb nom olganlar. Zamonaviy o\'zbek adabiyotida O\'tkir Hosh hem nasrdagi shoir,\nyetuk asarlarini esa nasro\narona deb atash\nmumkin.\nNashriyotimiz O\'zbekiston xalq yozuvchisi, Davlat mu-kofoti sovrindori, „Buyuk xizmatlari uchun\" ordeni sohibi O\'tkir Hoshimovning roman va qissalari, hikoyalari dramalari, adabiy o\'ylari hamda maqolalarini chop etishni rejalashtirgan.\nIstedodli yozuvchi, xalqimiz mehrini ozongan adib O\'tkir Hoshimovning asarlari kitobsevar xalqimiz uchun munosib sovg\'a bo\'lishiga ishonamiz.',18000,0,NULL,12,'uz','latin','soft',2025,222,1,55,0,1,0,0,1,0,1,0,0,0,'[-0.0060672774, -0.022408556, -0.0038820044, 0.031032631, -0.009343724, -0.040651344, -0.0019629428, 0.0035689867, -0.013936601, -0.051580634, -0.033958033, -0.055559177, 0.015832258, -0.0043734713, 0.02962844, 0.056354884, -0.03870888, 0.020079939, 0.02955823, 0.040370505, -0.023882957, -0.016077993, -0.009115543, -0.004452457, 0.012087748, 0.038802493, -0.0036099423, -0.0013186235, 0.05836756, -0.026492413, 0.039200347, -0.02134371, 0.027756184, -0.011578729, -0.005812768, -0.0047918037, 0.01209945, -0.021659654, 0.017060926, -0.021589445, -0.021601146, -0.02390636, 0.0052686436, -0.043249097, 0.036274947, -0.013094085, 0.007249139, -0.055325143, 0.0498488, -0.0031974611, -0.043740567, 0.016089695, -0.04434905, 0.0483978, 0.017493885, -0.011093113, 0.00017881501, -0.003343731, 0.0014502666, -0.023192562, -0.022408556, -0.015329091, 0.0019600173, 0.04928712, 0.012087748, -0.0019307632, -0.036345158, -0.026211575, -0.008992677, 0.022829814, 0.049521152, 0.013655762, 0.08308133, 0.008278879, 0.0359473, -0.026000945, 0.014790817, 0.014311052, 0.007828368, -0.010759617, -0.028130636, 0.023239369, -0.055465564, 0.03695364, -0.02059481, 0.017107733, -0.07343922, 0.0062076966, 0.015726944, -0.07020958, -0.039551392, 0.046455335, 0.012052644, -0.021168187, 0.03348997, 0.00075182755, 0.06496726, -0.000832276, -0.015645033, -0.030002892, -0.0043880986, -0.026024349, -0.0023198414, 0.0430852