an, murosasozlik\nyo\'liga kirmagan. U otkinchi mayllarga berilmay, so\'z san\'atining azaliy muammosi - shaxs jumbog\'i, ijtimoiy\nadolat tuyg\'usi bilan qiziqdi. Adabiyot dunyosida „nasr-\ndagi tarona\", „nasrdagi shoir\" atamalari bor. Yangi o\'zbek adabiyotida Abdulla Qodiriy bilan Said Ahmad haqli ravishda prozaning shoiri deb nom olganlar. Zamonaviy o\'zbek adabiyotida Otkir Hoshimovni ham nasrdagi shoir,\nyetuk asarlarini esa nasrdagi go\'shiq, tarona deb atash mumkin.\nNashriyotimiz O\'zbekiston xalq yozuvchisi, Davlat\nkofoti sovrindori, „Buyuk xizmatlari uchun\" ordeni sch\nOtkir Hoshimovning roman va qissalari, hikoyalari dramalari, adabiy o\'ylari hamda maqolalarini etishni rejalashtirgan.\nIstedodli yozuvchi, xalqimiz mehrini qozongan edib Oukir\nHoshimovning asarlari kitobsevar xalgimiz uchun\nmunosib sovg\'a bo\'lishiga ishonamiz.',18000,0,NULL,11,'uz','latin','soft',2025,190,1,55,0,1,1,18000,2,1,2,18000,0,0,'[-0.013642997, -0.03628922, 0.014149572, 0.025052456, -0.030578734, -0.014679174, -0.008416059, -0.0054802247, -0.002840852, -0.064012714, -0.0058544, -0.041447077, 0.042713515, -0.0027660169, 0.031154387, 0.07331528, -0.011317356, 0.0021615804, 0.011893009, 0.027815595, -0.015934099, -0.028276118, -0.023521217, 0.033549108, -0.011397947, 0.031246493, -0.005235572, -0.012641359, 0.07907181, -0.044509556, 0.042782597, -0.026549157, 0.02760836, 0.0034165056, -0.018455463, -0.0007670588, 0.0047923187, -0.05268384, 0.01709692, 0.017050868, -0.028759668, -0.021817282, -0.005845765, -0.02360181, 0.0313386, -0.022174187, -0.0053909984, -0.06175615, 0.02319885, -0.0040698727, -0.0136199705, 0.027815595, -0.033203714, 0.027262967, 0.032605037, -0.01994065, -0.0023385938, 0.022243265, 0.0046743094, -0.025466926, 0.011403703, -0.011633965, 0.02514456, 0.032259643, 0.035667513, -0.006067392, -0.023060694, -0.025766267, -0.0053478247, 0.0176956, 0.028114935, 0.079624444, 0.08049944, 0.011018015, 0.034401074, -0.0050053103, 0.025651136, -0.0008944222, 0.045131